WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:30.833
At the close of Chapter 11,

2
00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:32.666
Lord Krishna makes clear

3
00:00:32.666 --> 00:00:34.291
that the path to Him

4
00:00:34.291 --> 00:00:36.208
lies only in devotion,

5
00:00:36.208 --> 00:00:40.583
in that pure service offered
with undivided devotion.

6
00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:43.083
The previous verses have established

7
00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:46.916
that Vedic knowledge, intense
austerity, or great sacrifice,

8
00:00:46.916 --> 00:00:49.250
none of these are the means to reach

9
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.208
Lord Krishna.

10
00:00:51.208 --> 00:00:52.458
Now in this verse,

11
00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:54.833
He reveals the one path

12
00:00:54.833 --> 00:00:57.166
that truly leads to Him.

13
00:00:57.166 --> 00:00:59.750
In this verse, Lord Krishna gives Arjun

14
00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:00.875
the five essential

15
00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:03.208
principles of pure devotion,

16
00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:07.000
which are necessary for every seeker.

17
00:01:11.833 --> 00:01:15.333
Lord Krishna gives Arjun a direct

18
00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:18.083
and practical way to attain Him.

19
00:01:18.083 --> 00:01:19.541
Unlike the Vishwarupa

20
00:01:19.541 --> 00:01:23.541
or the formless Brahman,
Lord Krishna's two-armed form

21
00:01:23.541 --> 00:01:25.291
can be attained only through ananya bhakti,

22
00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:28.458
exclusive love.

23
00:01:28.458 --> 00:01:30.833
Here Lord Krishna gives Arjun

24
00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:33.083
the five key principles

25
00:01:33.083 --> 00:01:35.875
of pure devotional service:

26
00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:38.083
Working for Him,

27
00:01:38.083 --> 00:01:40.375
making Him the supreme goal,

28
00:01:40.375 --> 00:01:42.083
becoming His devotee,

29
00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:45.166
avoiding material attachment
and harmful company,

30
00:01:45.166 --> 00:01:49.250
and remaining free from enmity toward all.

31
00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:51.500
By following these principles,

32
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.416
anyone can rise above material bondage

33
00:01:54.416 --> 00:01:58.375
and reach Lord Krishna's eternal abode.

34
00:01:58.375 --> 00:02:02.875
Mat-karma-krit means
working for Lord Krishna,

35
00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:05.041
not in a passive way,

36
00:02:05.041 --> 00:02:07.708
but through active service:

37
00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:10.750
worshipping in the temple, sharing

38
00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:12.250
spiritual knowledge,

39
00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:16.041
and dedicating one's entire life to Him.

40
00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:19.791
“Mat-paramah”, highlights

41
00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:21.500
that Lord Krishna must be the supreme

42
00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:23.375
goal of life.

43
00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:25.166
Temporary material

44
00:02:25.166 --> 00:02:28.375
duties remain, but a devotee

45
00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:29.875
places Lord Krishna

46
00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:31.791
above all of these.

47
00:02:31.791 --> 00:02:32.666
When spiritual

48
00:02:32.666 --> 00:02:33.541
progress and

49
00:02:33.541 --> 00:02:36.625
material activity conflict,

50
00:02:36.625 --> 00:02:38.875
the devotee chooses Lord Krishna,

51
00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:40.208
understanding

52
00:02:40.208 --> 00:02:43.916
that material success comes second.

53
00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:46.166
Mad-bhaktah speaks of the importance

54
00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:48.208
of personal devotion:

55
00:02:48.208 --> 00:02:50.833
chanting Lord Krishna's holy names,

56
00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:53.750
hearing about Him, and remembering Him.

57
00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:56.541
True devotion carries no desire

58
00:02:56.541 --> 00:02:57.708
for reward, that is, karma,

59
00:02:57.708 --> 00:02:59.125
and no mixing of

60
00:02:59.125 --> 00:03:01.750
mere intellectual knowledge.

61
00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:03.333
“Sanga-varjitah”

62
00:03:03.333 --> 00:03:05.166
This warns against negative

63
00:03:05.166 --> 00:03:07.291
company.

64
00:03:07.291 --> 00:03:08.833
A devotee avoids those

65
00:03:08.833 --> 00:03:10.958
who are opposed to Lord Krishna,

66
00:03:10.958 --> 00:03:14.041
but holds no hatred toward them.

67
00:03:14.041 --> 00:03:15.250
Instead,

68
00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:19.250
they act fearlessly, with
nirvairah sarva-bhuteshu.

69
00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:21.916
Maintaining compassion and
freedom from envy,

70
00:03:21.916 --> 00:03:25.708
they wish well for all.

71
00:03:25.708 --> 00:03:26.875
As Arjun

72
00:03:26.875 --> 00:03:28.666
prepares for battle,

73
00:03:28.666 --> 00:03:30.833
Lord Krishna reminds him

74
00:03:30.833 --> 00:03:33.958
that his actions are driven
not by personal hatred,

75
00:03:33.958 --> 00:03:37.250
but by the duty of dharma.

76
00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.250
A devotee

77
00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:41.166
can firmly face injustice

78
00:03:41.166 --> 00:03:44.125
or oppose wrongdoing,

79
00:03:44.125 --> 00:03:48.041
but the purpose is never revenge.

80
00:03:48.041 --> 00:03:51.541
This reflects the higher
consciousness of a devotee

81
00:03:51.541 --> 00:03:57.166
who sees every situation as Lord Krishna's will.

82
00:03:57.166 --> 00:03:59.500
Lord Krishna's final assurance,

83
00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.166
“mam eti”,

84
00:04:01.166 --> 00:04:05.250
affirms that whoever walks this path

85
00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:08.333
will certainly attain Him.

86
00:04:08.333 --> 00:04:09.000
This verse

87
00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.000
serves as the pinnacle of

88
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.708
Chapter 11,

89
00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:15.583
affirming that

90
00:04:15.583 --> 00:04:17.833
devotion is not just the means,

91
00:04:17.833 --> 00:04:21.125
but the true goal of life.

92
00:04:21.125 --> 00:04:23.083
Through steadfast devotion,

93
00:04:23.083 --> 00:04:28.666
one returns to Lord Krishna's eternal abode.

94
00:04:33.125 --> 00:04:37.166
When I say let go of enmity,

95
00:04:37.166 --> 00:04:39.125
you may ask

96
00:04:39.125 --> 00:04:41.875
why I say this.

97
00:04:41.875 --> 00:04:44.250
Think about it,

98
00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:47.000
carrying hostility in the heart

99
00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:51.208
is like walking with a stone tied to your back.

100
00:04:51.208 --> 00:04:53.625
It weighs you down,

101
00:04:53.625 --> 00:04:57.125
it slows your pace,

102
00:04:57.125 --> 00:05:00.458
and fills the mind with confusion.

103
00:05:00.458 --> 00:05:04.375
When you hold a grudge against someone,

104
00:05:04.375 --> 00:05:08.000
without knowing it, invisible ropes

105
00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:11.458
bind you.

106
00:05:11.458 --> 00:05:13.041
Strange, isn't it.

107
00:05:13.041 --> 00:05:16.250
The very person you want to be free of

108
00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:21.166
is the one you remain bound to.

109
00:05:21.166 --> 00:05:26.750
How can a mind full of anger
and bitterness find freedom?

110
00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:29.500
Letting go of enmity

111
00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:32.291
does not mean accepting injustice.

112
00:05:32.291 --> 00:05:34.208
It means

113
00:05:34.208 --> 00:05:36.625
freeing yourself from the burden

114
00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:40.625
that keeps you captive.

115
00:05:40.625 --> 00:05:43.583
Just as a bird with stones tied to its wings

116
00:05:43.583 --> 00:05:45.000
cannot fly,

117
00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:49.500
a mind full of negative feelings

118
00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:52.916
cannot make spiritual progress.

119
00:05:52.916 --> 00:05:58.208
Forgiveness will lighten the heart,

120
00:05:58.208 --> 00:06:01.916
clear the mind, and open the path.

121
00:06:01.916 --> 00:06:05.458
When you let go of the desire to hurt

122
00:06:05.458 --> 00:06:09.208
or blame others,

123
00:06:09.208 --> 00:06:13.583
space is made for peace and compassion.

124
00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:16.208
And in that space,

125
00:06:16.208 --> 00:06:18.291
you will clearly experience

126
00:06:18.291 --> 00:06:21.625
My presence,

127
00:06:21.625 --> 00:06:25.166
which will lead you toward true freedom

128
00:06:25.166 --> 00:06:27.958
and joy.

129
00:06:32.541 --> 00:06:35.833
Loving Me does not mean

130
00:06:35.833 --> 00:06:39.291
that you spend all day in worship

131
00:06:39.291 --> 00:06:42.833
and ignore the people around you.

132
00:06:42.833 --> 00:06:45.208
That is not true devotion.

133
00:06:45.208 --> 00:06:47.333
True devotion means

134
00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:49.541
keeping Me in your heart while

135
00:06:49.541 --> 00:06:52.916
treating your family and others with kindness

136
00:06:52.916 --> 00:06:56.916
and compassion.

137
00:06:56.916 --> 00:06:58.541
Every person

138
00:06:58.541 --> 00:07:01.125
you meet

139
00:07:01.125 --> 00:07:03.416
is My child.

140
00:07:03.416 --> 00:07:06.375
When you treat them with love

141
00:07:06.375 --> 00:07:09.541
and respect,

142
00:07:09.541 --> 00:07:13.791
you honour Me too.

143
00:07:13.791 --> 00:07:18.000
If your actions cause sorrow to those

144
00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.750
who stand by you in life,

145
00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.125
what is the use of your

146
00:07:23.125 --> 00:07:25.916
spiritual activities?

147
00:07:25.916 --> 00:07:27.625
Devotion,

148
00:07:27.625 --> 00:07:30.208
when done from the heart,

149
00:07:30.208 --> 00:07:33.666
brings harmony to the home.

150
00:07:33.666 --> 00:07:37.916
When your heart is filled with My love,

151
00:07:37.916 --> 00:07:41.541
it naturally reflects in your behaviour

152
00:07:41.541 --> 00:07:44.750
with your family,

153
00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.583
in your speech,

154
00:07:46.583 --> 00:07:50.666
in your actions, in your

155
00:07:50.666 --> 00:07:52.000
thoughts.

156
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.416
You become more patient

157
00:07:54.416 --> 00:07:56.458
with your children,

158
00:07:56.458 --> 00:07:59.666
more understanding toward your spouse,

159
00:07:59.666 --> 00:08:01.500
and one who carries deeper

160
00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.708
respect for your elders.

161
00:08:04.708 --> 00:08:09.375
Just as a lamp illuminates the entire room,

162
00:08:09.375 --> 00:08:12.166
devotion to Me

163
00:08:12.166 --> 00:08:15.291
illuminates your relationships,

164
00:08:15.291 --> 00:08:17.291
removes confusion,

165
00:08:17.291 --> 00:08:20.458
and nourishes trust.

166
00:08:20.458 --> 00:08:22.000
Remember,

167
00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:26.083
the love you show to others

168
00:08:26.083 --> 00:08:27.458
is also

169
00:08:27.458 --> 00:08:30.000
a way of expressing your love

170
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.541
for Me.

171
00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:39.791
In professional life, success comes

172
00:08:39.791 --> 00:08:43.000
when you adopt the same principles

173
00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.791
I taught Arjun.

174
00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:48.250
First, work with dedication

175
00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.875
and purpose,

176
00:08:50.875 --> 00:08:53.250
not merely for a salary, but

177
00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:56.458
with the spirit of giving your very best.

178
00:08:56.458 --> 00:09:00.416
When you see your work as service,

179
00:09:00.416 --> 00:09:04.291
it becomes more meaningful.

180
00:09:04.291 --> 00:09:06.000
Second,

181
00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:10.541
always keep your ultimate goal in mind.

182
00:09:10.541 --> 00:09:13.916
Know why you are working,

183
00:09:13.916 --> 00:09:17.291
and let that goal guide

184
00:09:17.291 --> 00:09:20.125
your actions.

185
00:09:20.125 --> 00:09:21.750
Third,

186
00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:24.250
do your work with enthusiasm

187
00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:27.208
and commitment.

188
00:09:27.208 --> 00:09:30.416
Just as a devotee serves Me with love,

189
00:09:30.416 --> 00:09:35.000
without true enthusiasm,

190
00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:39.291
even the best opportunities lose their impact.

191
00:09:39.291 --> 00:09:43.500
Fourth, avoid negative company.

192
00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.000
Stay away from pointless gossip, envy,

193
00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:49.916
and unhealthy competition.

194
00:09:49.916 --> 00:09:52.083
Be with those who encourage

195
00:09:52.083 --> 00:09:54.041
and inspire you.

196
00:09:54.041 --> 00:09:55.708
And finally,

197
00:09:55.708 --> 00:09:57.875
let go of bitterness

198
00:09:57.875 --> 00:10:01.208
and envy toward others.

199
00:10:01.208 --> 00:10:03.958
Success lies not in pulling others down,

200
00:10:03.958 --> 00:10:07.666
but in moving forward together.

201
00:10:07.666 --> 00:10:10.916
When you work with honesty, dedication,

202
00:10:10.916 --> 00:10:12.958
and compassion,

203
00:10:12.958 --> 00:10:16.625
you not only fulfil your goals,

204
00:10:16.625 --> 00:10:17.666
but also

205
00:10:17.666 --> 00:10:22.416
find respect and satisfaction along the way.
